{%- comment -%}
  Product page shipping estimator: the customer enters a Canadian postal code or a US ZIP code and sees the shipping cost for the chosen variant
  and the delivery dates if they order today. Rates and times depend on the country (not the exact address), so the code is used to tell Canada from the United States.
  The code stays in the browser only (localStorage); nothing is sent anywhere. Before a code is entered, estimates show for the visitor's country. Prices come from the same weight bands as the shipping line below it
  (read from [data-ship] by drape.js), so there is one place to change them: snippets/ship-estimate.liquid.
  The day ranges below must match the delivery times in locales/en.default.json (trust_ship_b): 13-25 days to Canada, 10-20 days to the U.S.
  Hidden until the script runs, so without JavaScript the plain shipping line is shown instead.
  Usage: render 'ship-estimator', weight: variant.weight
{%- endcomment -%}
<div class="shipper" data-shipper hidden data-weight="{{ weight }}" data-default="{{ localization.country.iso_code }}" data-days-ca="13,25" data-days-us="10,20">
  <div class="sh-head">
    <form class="sh-form" data-sh-form novalidate>
      <label class="sh-label" for="sh-code">Check delivery to your door</label>
      <div class="sh-field">
        <input id="sh-code" name="code" type="text" autocomplete="postal-code" autocapitalize="characters" spellcheck="false" maxlength="10" placeholder="Postal or ZIP code" data-sh-input>
        <button type="submit">Check</button>
      </div>
      <p class="sh-err" data-sh-err role="alert" hidden></p>
    </form>
    <div class="sh-set" data-sh-set hidden>
      <span>Delivering to <strong data-sh-code></strong></span>
      <button type="button" data-sh-change>Change</button>
    </div>
  </div>
  <ul class="sh-rows">
    <li>
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 7h11v9H3z"/><path d="M14 10h4l3 3v3h-7"/><circle cx="7" cy="18" r="1.6"/><circle cx="17" cy="18" r="1.6"/></svg>
      <div><strong data-sh-cost>Shipping for this item</strong><span>Shipping is by weight, so adding items changes the total. Taxes extra.</span></div>
    </li>
    <li>
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3.5" y="5" width="17" height="15" rx="2.5"/><path d="M3.5 10h17M8 3v4M16 3v4"/></svg>
      <div><strong data-sh-date>Estimated delivery</strong><span>If you order today. Dates are estimates: we send every order through our fulfilment partners, so busy seasons or carrier delays can add a little time. Every order ships with tracking, so you can follow it all the way to your door.</span></div>
    </li>
  </ul>
</div>
